{"ref":"BDB, מְהֵרָה","hw":"מְהֵרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְהֵרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. haste, speed</strong>;—usually as adverb. acc. <em>hastily, quickly:</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:19\" href=\"/Joshua.8.19\">Jos 8:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:6\" href=\"/Joshua.10.6\">10:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:16\" href=\"/Joshua.23.16\">23:16</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:11\" href=\"/Numbers.17.11\">Nu 17:11</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.17\">Dt 11:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:54\" href=\"/Judges.9.54\">Ju 9:54</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.16\">2 S 17:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.16\">Je 27:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.11\">Ec 8:11</a> (in all these cases after vb.); before vb. (poet.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.26\">Is 5:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קַל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:3\" href=\"/Psalms.31.3\">ψ 31:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:2\" href=\"/Psalms.37.2\">37:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.8\">Is 58:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jo 4:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קַל</span>); so also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:38\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.38\">1 S 20:38</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הוּשָׁה</span> (cf. Dr); <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.11\">2 K 1:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ רֵ֑דָה</span>;—but perhaps read <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֲרָה</span>, i.e. <em>Pi</em>. Imv. of <span dir=\"rtl\">מהר</span> (cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.27\">1 S 23:27</a>); c. prep. (late): <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּמ׳</span> <em>in haste</em> = quickly <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.12\">Ec 4:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־מ׳</span>, <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:15\" href=\"/Psalms.147.15\">ψ 147:15</a>.","next":"BDB, מַהֲרַי","prev":"BDB, מָהִיר"}